 "description": "Return the current value of Argentina's headline indicators in one call: USD retail and wholesale (BCRA), blue, MEP and CCL dollars, the blue FX gap, country risk (EMBI), monthly and annual inflation, BADLAR and TAMAR rates and international reserves. Each comes with its date, source, page URL and the change versus 7 days, 30 days (previous month for monthly series) and one year earlier. Use it for \"how is the economy doing today\" or to compare now against a week, a month or a year ago; use get_series for history, get_projection for the future and get_weekly_summary for the narrative of a closed week. Indicators whose source does not answer are listed under \"missing\" instead of failing the call. Read-only, no side effects, no authentication. Rate limited to 60 calls per minute per IP. Data updates at most once per business day.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "properties": {},
  "type": "object"
 },
